WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:05.930
Go gather info on the most recent
activities of the Reiken Sect.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:09.170
Every sect has its weak spot, so try and start there.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:16.870
They're not going to respond to any negotiations,
but this should at least buy us some time.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:21.040
Let's not awaken the sleeping lion just yet.

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:28.880
A parcel sent with a flying sword?

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:33.380
Guess this is what the Seikyo Sect is
bribing us with to keep our mouths shut.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.010
T-This is!

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:45.380
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:15.510
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.210
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:25.730
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:32.890
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:38.600
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:42.950
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:48.890
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:53.220
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:56.260
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:00.440
whose name we've yet to know

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:12.550
I'm here Chief.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:15.320
Oh, are these donkey burgers?

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:17.530
Don't eat them!

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.110
Are they not normal burgers?

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:22.870
The Seikyo Sect sent them.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.350
I don't see anything abnormal...

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.000
Is it meat from a divine beast?

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:31.380
I checked with my Daien Clairvoyance...

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.950
H-How can anyone be so cruel?

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:40.220
At least it's better than death. What was once
lost can probably still grow back in 10 years.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:45.390
There's also a piece of Genten Crystal
worth about one million Ryo inside.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.210
Seems like Seikyo wants to end
this matter with a little negotiation,

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.650
but I don't intend to go along so easily.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.150
Which means?

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:59.610
White Moon Country is in the Sokei Region,
not far from the Reiken Sect.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:02.000
According to the 7th Elder,

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:10.430
there has recently been a number of small
faux sects emerging throughout the region.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:13.740
Like the one Obu just encountered.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:16.670
Which means what we saw was
just the tip of the iceberg.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:21.550
Since we are blessed by the divine
Ki of the Sokei region,

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.430
our sect should take responsibility for this region.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:29.670
I agree, but what do you plan to do?

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:32.060
Expand our territory?

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:36.900
No, I was thinking about sending out
disciples who have been with us

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.450
for less than ten years out into the normal world.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.100
So you believe cultivation on
the mountain alone will not suffice?

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:48.580
Some real experience throughout the Nine Regions
will go a long way in their path of cultivation.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.340
But what you're suggesting...

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:54.140
Isn't this the same exact route we took 100 years ago?

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:55.500
We shouldn't repeat that kind of traged—

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.510
Calm down, I'm not sending them to plow
the unknown and untreated land.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:03.180
I'm just asking them to clear
the trash in the Sokei Region.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:10.410
No longer than 10 years of cultivation means those
around the middle of the Foundation Stage...

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.390
Will they be capable enough?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.020
That's why it's called a trial.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.760
Ryuken, have some faith in our disciples.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.030
You're right.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.950
Your food is seriously fantastic!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:28.280
Well I didn't cultivate my cooking techniques
for nothing after all these years!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.970
Even though "all these years"
means two years at Ryoka Inn.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.370
And your selection of ingredients is exceptional.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.540
Even though they're left overs from other shops.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:37.920
I'm addicted to this taste.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:42.090
I don't think we'll learn anything of value
from lower-level disciples like these.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.730
But it would be a bit challenging
to actually enter the sect.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.090
Look!

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.130
A red and white colored robe.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:50.970
It's the legacy disciple.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.330
Looks like someone's in a hurry.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:56.230
He's going to meet up with
someone in the western woods.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:00.110
Did he even get permission to leave the mountain?

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.530
There's the weak link.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.530
Don't set up a shop in front of my inn!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:08.890
We lost him.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.460
Can I help you?

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.970
You guys are from the Seikyo Sect, right?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:28.800
Just lookin' to pick a fight?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.880
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.440
You're late, O-san.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:49.950
My bad, got caught up with some
over-enthusiastic members from my fan club.

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:53.200
You haven't changed a bit.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:55.450
Foundation Stage?

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:58.840
Yes, although further confirmation is needed.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:02.340
Even as a legacy disciple, he shouldn't be this
strong after only being in the sect for two years.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:07.010
I was right to not underestimate them.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:12.240
I'll go back one more time.
You two continue to gather some info.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.880
Teacher, please have some tea.

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:48.970
<i>Is this a trick? Maybe it's poisoned?</i>

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.040
<i>Tastes bad, as expected.</i>

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.520
So what do you want?

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.310
How'd you end up banging the 7th elder?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.650
I'm gonna help you get your mind out of the gutter,

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.730
take my brainwashing sword ki!

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.110
What? Nothing happened.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.120
Well it hurt a bit.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:19.960
That must mean you've already reached
the 8th, no, 9th stage Amorphic Bones.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:27.630
But I don't recall ever leaving you guides
for the 9th stage. How'd you get there?

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.300
7th Elder taught me.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.300
Oh, that blackie...

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.550
So what did you really want to ask?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.950
About him.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:35.920
That's a girl's...secret.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.350
That's a girl's...secret.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:36.830
That's a girl's...secret.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.990
That's a girl's...secret.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:42.510
You're too old to say something like that.

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:45.590
I want to know what happened during the duel.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:51.680
Oh, well not much. I just disposed of some trash
who happened to be a nascent soul cultivator.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.410
But you're only at JinDan stage right?

00:07:55.720 --> 00:08:00.450
Well yeah. Normally a cultivator
is supposed to go from JinDan

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:07.490
to Nascent Soul, to Semi-Deity, to Fusion,
to Enlightenment, and then finally Apotheosis.

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:11.720
But in reality, the stages after
JinDan are not so straightforward.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:20.140
They're all simply different ways and starting
points to reaching the same destination.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:26.020
The further you go on your
own path, the stronger you get.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.270
I've never heard of this way of thought.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:32.040
Well of course, it's my own theory.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.660
I was about to publish it, but it fell through.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.700
Am I supposed to be surprised by that?

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:42.660
It's only a rough hypothesis for now,
so you don't need to take it too seriously.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.750
What you really want now is
to learn the Amorphic Sword, right?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:47.790
Please teach me.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.490
Which one do you want to learn?

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:50.810
How many are there?

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:54.340
Not that many, about 20.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.470
Could you eliminate some of them for me?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:03.260
You have potential, so I suggest
one of two ways to start.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:09.480
Either the way of the endurance, or the way of wisdom.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:13.740
Both are difficult in their own right.
Which one would you prefer?

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.950
Way of wisdom.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.660
As expected of the nerd.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:24.910
<i>I'm just afraid the way of endurance would
mean training for a hundred years or something.</i>

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:30.640
The training for Amorphic Sword
is aided by Amorphic Sets.

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:35.800
Since your Amorphic Bones is now completed,
you can now gather ki in your body.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:40.050
This is a routine you must follow everyday.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:44.560
The sword set you're about to learn
is the result of combining

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:47.070
the essence of all other sword sets in the world,

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:49.810
thus making it capable of defeating them all as well.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:53.820
<i>Is this some sort of shameless plug?</i>

00:09:54.820 --> 00:10:00.570
The first step is to memorize all
these beginner sword sets.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:07.180
<i>The sword sets weren't difficult for me.</i>

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:10.360
<i>I mastered them in a matter of days.</i>

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:14.460
Well done, now on to the next step.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:18.610
You'll now have to create a sword
set that's most suitable for you.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.590
Create?

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.690
I'm such a liberal and democratic teacher right?

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:25.890
Quit kidding around and teach
me the Amorphic Sword Set.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:33.340
Unfortunately, I wasn't joking around this time.
A sword set is guidance for the practice of killing.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:36.800
A fixed sword set is open to its fixed weakness.

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:41.450
To overcome this you'll have
to create your own sword set

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:46.410
and let it evolve with time,
just like the Amorphic Sets.

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:51.660
This is the path that I myself walked before.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:56.730
Whether you can make it or
not solely depends on you.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:57.420
Good luck.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.840
I have some urgent matters to attend to.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.470
Liar! I know you're just heading out to drink!

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.180
<i>Since it's sword arts, I can't go
wrong by asking Rei-san for help.</i>

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:14.770
<i>Closed? And Rei is nowhere around either.</i>

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:20.030
<i>For real? Where am I gonna eat now?</i>

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:29.040
<i>I can find the weakness in the beginner
sword sets by simulating them in my head.</i>

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:33.240
<i>But creating my own set is
a completely different matter.</i>

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:38.320
<i>I can try with some small movements, but it'll be
nowhere near the consistency of the sets in these books.</i>

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:43.430
<i>My teacher said this step will have a big effect
on the progression of my Amorphic Sword...</i>

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:44.350
Excuse me.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:50.230
Sorry but you've been sitting still with a stern
expression on your face for quite some time now...

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:53.480
Is it perhaps because my new
menu doesn't suit your taste?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.690
No no, I was just too absorbed in my thoughts.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:03.450
Speaking of which, your menu has some really
fun names, like this "Loch Ness Monster."

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.490
I know what you're doing.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:11.520
A good soldier can endure pain by distracting himself.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.710
I'm sorry for what you've suffered.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.720
You're thinking too much.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:19.130
My teacher asked me to create my own sword set,

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:21.550
so I was just focused on simulating the moves in my head.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.510
You know sword arts!?

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:29.010
Sorry didn't mean to sound rude.
I was just surprised.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.890
But why do you go about your sword
practice in such a half-assed manner?

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.750
Half-assed?

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:41.000
I was using my superior brain power
to simulate the moves of the sword sets.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:44.320
That's efficient, how is that half-assed?

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:49.830
Sword art is not born out of
imagination, but real practice.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.290
My teacher told me this sword set starts with wisdom.

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:57.920
Thanks for the meal, I'm heading out.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.940
According to my understanding
of the language of the Nine Regions,

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:04.850
wisdom is completely different from intelligence.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.400
Intelligence is mostly something you're born with.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:13.480
But wisdom is the result of the experience of life
coupled with the accumulation of knowledge.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:20.690
The way of wisdom is the way of real experience,
simulation alone will achieve nothing.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.980
I see.

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.700
Such an enlightening explanation.

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:26.860
You should help me practice.

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:32.680
With such a deep understanding of the sword,
there's no way you're just a cook.

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.120
I bet you're some master swordsman.

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.290
I'm really just a cook.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.260
Please allow me to call you teacher.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:54.140
Fine. I'll practice with you, but I'm in no way
your teacher, just an opponent to practice on.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:56.810
Just as I thought.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.480
Sorry to keep you waiting, let's begin.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.700
<i>Such clean moves.</i>

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:13.120
<i>She's so strong, no doubt she's
been through countless fights.</i>

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:20.830
<i>Oriku worked on his sword arts
with her for the following two months.</i>

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.550
Sorry, please let me pass through.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:31.820
Here here, Oriku your seat is right beside mine.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:33.270
Thank you.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:39.340
Guess that's everybody. Let's begin.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:44.510
<i>Huh? For real? Everyone including
the elders were waiting for me?</i>

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:51.740
<i>How could this happen, aren't you guys
the ones we're supposed to be waiting on?</i>

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:58.420
I gathered all of you here to task
you with an important mission.

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:01.880
Elder Ryuken will explain it in detail.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.690
I'll explain the trial you're about to
undertake in the world of the commoner.

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:13.930
We have built a program designed to further your
cultivation and improve your individual abilities.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:19.470
You are to live in the world of the commoner
while completing various kinds of trials.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:24.400
Before that, please turn your attention towards
the committee of elders in charge of the program.

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:29.780
The trials that take place in the normal
world won't just be a set of simple missions.

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:33.940
You'll have to write a report
detailing all the actions you take.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:35.280
So basically—

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:39.370
<i>The Reiken Sect feels that they've
been too quiet as of late </i>

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:44.040
<i>and they want to get some events going on to
build up their reputation in the normal world?</i>

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:48.390
<i>The explanation continued on for a while. </i>

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:54.800
<i>Long story short, the trial was made to allow disciples
lower than the Foundation Stage to leave the mountain</i>

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.060
<i>and gain some experience in the commoner's world. </i>

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:02.690
Don't get ahead of yourself, this is not a vacation.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:07.860
Like Elder Kaun said, you'll have to submit
a report of five thousand words at the minimum.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:13.450
That's no problem for a nerd like myself.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:19.040
I could write a perfect report right now
without even attending the one year trial.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:27.420
Well it's also a chance for you guys to cut
your emotional ties with the normal world.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.430
Emotional ties?

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:39.470
Indeed. It's inevitable since the world of cultivation
and world of the commoner are so drastically different.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.660
The biggest difference between
a cultivator and a normal person

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:46.340
isn't their difference in strength,
but in their lifespans.

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:52.380
Even at the Ki Gathering Stage, there are disciples
with a base life span longer than 150 years.

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:56.490
At Foundation Stage your life span will be 200 years,

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:01.710
Pseudo-Dan stage is 300 years, JinDan 400 years,
and that's only the minimum.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:05.490
The moment you started cultivation,

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:15.130
you were burdened with the pain of seeing your family
and friends from the normal world eventually pass away.

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:23.140
<i>I don't care about cutting emotional ties or whatever,
I'm just excited to finally go home.</i>

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:29.300
With my current sword skills I'm pretty much invincible
in the normal world, this will be a piece of cake!

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:33.150
Invincible? You think this trial is some kind of a joke?

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:39.520
Teacher, a weakling like me will need to have a lot of gold
to support myself, or I'll end up dying in the normal world!

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:43.350
What? I have some metal if you want.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:47.180
What happened to the goods and the gear
you got from Shiho a few days ago?

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.420
Don't tell me you've already squandered them all.

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:52.420
Uh...What?

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:57.180
Is that Divine Spring Spirit?
You probably spent all the gold on that...

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:02.810
What to do, I should probably give
you a parting gift as your teacher.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.310
Here.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:07.440
What the hell is this?

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.190
You're giving me a toothpick as a parting gift?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:14.600
Did the food at Ethereal Hall finally get to your head?

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.350
You already forgot?

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:19.180
Oh, it's the Kozan Sword.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.080
Of course it is. How's that a toothpick.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:28.940
The Kozan Sword is a divine weapon. At your current
stage it'd impossible for you to mess anything up.

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:33.210
Problem is, there's still a sword spirit residing within it.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.470
The spirit of the sword...

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:38.720
The spirit is over a thousand years old.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:45.220
It can't be completely controlled even by
someone at the JinDan Stage, much less by you.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.480
It's up to you to decide whether you
want to keep the spirit or not.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:04.800
Uh... Hello.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:09.520
My name is RyanShu.

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:16.300
I have followed many masters but
have never betrayed a single one.

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:20.220
Will this kind of kid be okay?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.480
I'm sure it'll be an interesting journey.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.630
The older the spirit, the more valuable they usually are.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:38.480
The experience they gain throughout the years
is invaluable knowledge for the wielder.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:42.610
I cast nine layers of sealing spells as a safety precaution.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:47.740
But there's still no guarantee what
this thousand year old spirit will do.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:55.010
If you don't want to keep it, we can ask the Chief
to erase her memories so that she'll obey you.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:20:00.400
Even an idiot like Shiho didn't erase it,
there's no reason for me to do that.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:03.830
It's just a sword spirit, I'll have no
problem taming something like that.

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:08.680
It'll probably be just like taking care of an elderly aunt.
I grew up with my grandma so I got it covered.

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:13.310
I really think you should.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.040
Well then, I'll be heading out for the trial.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:20.190
I'll try my best to not disappoint you.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.950
I'm looking forward to your new breakthroughs.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.700
Where do you guys think you're touching!?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:31.120
I'll be going then, I'll bring back lots of souvenirs!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.130
Bunho-san you've been looking more fit recently.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.880
Really? Maybe even I will look cool someday.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.270
Yes, a cool Fatty McFatt.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:41.800
I-I guess so.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:45.970
Although it's called the trial in the normal world,

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.930
it's not much different from our
day-to-day lives as outer court disciples.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.930
You think so?

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:56.050
Speaking of which, whose actually your teacher?

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.220
It's a secret.

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:03.350
C'mon, don't tell me you're still
following your master Oriku?

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:06.950
No way, I just want to forget about him at this point.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.450
You want me to help you forget about him?

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:17.540
<i>The Reiken Sect's one year trial in
the normal world has officially begun.</i>

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.200
<i>All cultivators of less than ten
years have left the mountain.</i>

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:24.970
<i>Some leave full of motivation,
while some flounder in confusion.</i>

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:32.390
<i>While it's not the biggest part of the Nine Regions,
Sokei is still large enough for the newbies of the Reiken Sect.</i>

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:38.480
<i>The guide book details thousands of suitable "trial spots"
selected by the committee at the Office of Divine Tactics.</i>

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:45.490
<i>For Oriku, the trial is not as important
as his chance to finally return home.</i>

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:49.390
<i>It's a small village north-east of Kuji Mountain,</i>

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>located in the Buko prefecture of
the ToDo province, in the country of Daimin.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:57.370
<i>Oriku could feel his heart warming
up just at the thought of it.</i>

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:23.700
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:27.170
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:29.010
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:35.030
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:40.430
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.770 --> 00:22:51.280
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:57.720
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.450
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:04.650
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:10.210
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:15.800
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:25.900
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.820 --> 00:23:38.870
The start of new adventures,
we will be waiting for you at Mt. Reiken.
